{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00549","headline":"郊庙歌辞 禅社首乐章 寿和 · 贺知章、源乾曜","name":"郊庙歌辞 禅社首乐章 寿和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惟以明发，有怀载殷。\n乐盈而反，礼顺其禋。\n立清以献，荐欲是亲。\n於穆不已，裒对斯臻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺知章、源乾曜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}